+*   **Ray Sampling Points ($M$):** Number of points sampled along the ray [S3].
+*   **Loss Weights ($\alpha$):** Weight for depth loss in the total loss function $\mathcal{L} = \mathcal{L}_{color} + \alpha \mathcal{L}_{depth}$ [S3].
 
